# Web-storage keys that hold UI state rather than credentials, subtracted before
# the CI guard and tests/test_security.py fail the build. One fixed substring per
# line, matched anywhere on the offending line.
#
# Adding a line here is a security decision: record it in
# docs/security/credential-storage-review-*.md first.
#
# tf_import_session_* caches a draft import preview (project id, draft steps and
# the server-held test receipt) so a reload does not discard a passing draft. It
# carries no token, cookie or key; the access token itself is never persisted.
tf_import_session_
